# The model of plane_stress_strain with the CPE4 elements of PSTRAIN defined
# after its *SOLID SECTION; PSTRAIN is listed by *ELSET before the section.
# The plane option of PSTRAIN is taken from the CPE4 elements, so the right
# end moves by 2.0E-03 in PSTRESS and by 1.82E-03 in PSTRAIN.
!VERSION
 3
!SOLUTION, TYPE=STATIC
!BOUNDARY
 LEFT, 1, 1, 0.0
 BOTTOM, 2, 2, 0.0
!CLOAD
 RIGHT, 1, 0.5
!SOLVER, METHOD=CG, PRECOND=1, ITERLOG=NO, TIMELOG=NO
 10000, 1
 1.0e-10, 1.0, 0.0
!WRITE, RESULT
!END
